  "name": "Milkmaid's Pitcher Snapshot (5840a63c)",
  "description": "A digital sherd of Milkmaid's Pitcher, an interactive sculpture from the Dystopia of Imitation art project. Created through a WebGL/WebXR installation, each sherd captures a unique state of an animated virtual pitcher as it is manipulated by a participant.\nLike an archaeological fragment, the resulting 3D model preserves only a momentary part of a larger, mutable object—a record of interaction, transformation, and place within the digital sculpture.\nThis sherd was captured in Berlin at 52.517337, 13.370753.",
